 for inner peace and fulfillment.", "encoded_message": "Felicity constitutes an complicated notion who possesses existed considered through sages throughout era. This theory pertaining to contentment plus welfare aims in order to examine this character pertaining to sincere happiness and the manner in which it has the capacity to serve as achieved. As stated to certain thinkers, bliss represents not merely the void related to adverse feelings, however instead an condition concerning contentment and fulfillment. It is believed that true happiness can be achieved through virtue and living a meaningful life. Well-being, on the other hand, encompasses physical, mental, and emotional health. It emphasizes the importance of balance and harmony in all aspects of life. Ultimately, the philosophy of happiness and well-being encourages individuals to strive for inner peace and fulfillment.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 5.21, "secret_key_generation": 140.53}, "decoding_time": 0.0003058910369873047, "decoded_message": "1100000100001011010001000000100011001001101000110010101000000010", "error_message": ""}